### create poolParticipant (RETAILER only — user_ref is derived from the token, not sent)

POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "pool_ref": {{poolId}},
    "payment_ref": {{paymentId}},
    "address_ref": {{addressId}},
    "quantity": 15
}

### list poolParticipants (ADMIN sees all; anyone else only their own)

GET {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### list poolParticipants for a given pool (ADMIN use case: see everyone in a pool)

GET {{baseUrl}}?pool_ref={{poolId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### get poolParticipant by id

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### update poolParticipant (RETAILER, own participant only, only while the pool is still OPEN)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "quantity": 12
}

### delete poolParticipant (RETAILER, own participant only — pool OPEN, COMPLETED, or CANCELLED 7+ days ago)

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{poolParticipantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


